/: uav_error_check.ncds
/: UAV Error Check — capture images and analyse in a loop
/:
/: Dispatched from uav_mission.ncds via Distribute.
/: Captures inspection pictures at designated points, then analyses each
/: image in a loop to detect defects and anomalies. Produces a report.
/:
/: Execution order (inside-out, top-down):
/:   is criteria discussion required? — worker assesses if discussion is warranted
/:   refined criteria                 — only if discussion required (Distribute)
/:   default criteria                 — only if discussion NOT required
/:   analysis criteria                — select whichever criteria was produced
/:   inspection points                — extract from approved plan (syntactic)
/:   captured images                  — fly to each point and capture image
/:   image analyses                   — analyse each image in a loop
/:   error check report               — compile findings (root)
/:
/: Agents:
/:   planning_agent — assesses criteria need, compiles final report.
/:   drone_agent    — captures images at inspection points.
/:   analysis_agent — analyses each image against criteria.

<- error check report
    /: [planning_agent]
    <= compile error check report from all image analyses

    <- is criteria discussion required?
        /: [planning_agent]
        <= assess whether criteria discussion is warranted for this mission
        <- approved plan

    <- refined criteria
        /: Distribute -> uav_analysis_criteria.ncds
        <= load and refine analysis criteria with operator
            <= if criteria discussion required
            <* is criteria discussion required?
        <- approved plan

    <- default criteria
        <= load default analysis criteria for this mission type
            <= if criteria discussion NOT required
            <* is criteria discussion required?
        <- approved plan

    <- analysis criteria
        <= select criteria to use for this run
        <- refined criteria
        <- default criteria

    <- inspection points
        <= extract inspection points from approved plan
        <- approved plan

    <- captured images
        /: [drone_agent]
        <= capture images at all designated inspection points
        <- inspection points
        <- approved plan

    <- image analyses
        <= for every captured image

            <= return the image analysis per iteration

            <- image analysis
                /: [analysis_agent]
                <= analyse image for defects and anomalies
                <- captured image
                <- analysis criteria

        <- captured images
        <* captured image from captured images

    <- approved plan
